UPDATE companies SET description='Metalworking Group operates its Pippin Road facility in Cincinnati, Ohio, one of two plants the company runs in the city. The business traces its roots back more than 40 years, beginning with deep expertise in heavy plate and sheet metal fabrication. Today it is led by CEO Doug Watts and President Brian Dubay, who have overseen its evolution through strategic acquisitions and continuous technology investment.

The company produces sheet metal components, weldments, UL‑listed electrical enclosures, production stampings, stamping dies, fixtures, and CNC‑machined parts. Its shop floor includes 4‑axis vertical CNC machining centers, multi‑spindle lathe turning centers with live tooling, and four robotic welding cells for MIG, TIG, and robotic welding. Sheet processing capacity reaches 60 by 120 inches, and all manufacturing, finishing, assembly, kitting, packaging, warehousing, and distribution are performed in‑house.

Metalworking Group serves OEMs across the United States, Canada, and Western Europe. Its customer base spans defense and military, aerospace, medical device, fitness equipment, oil and gas, biogas reclaiming, border security, autonomous vehicle, industrial equipment, chemical dispensing, clean energy, material handling, and data‑center industries.

The firm emphasizes that ongoing investment in cutting‑edge equipment, top‑tier talent, and smarter workflows enables it to deliver precision‑built solutions and responsive support, aiming to function as an essential extension of its customers’ manufacturing teams. It holds UL Listing, ISO 9001, ITAR registration, and meets CMMC requirements for defense work.', certifications=ARRAY['UL Listed','ISO 9001','ITAR','CMMC']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Metal fabrication", "Precision machining (4-axis vertical CNC, multi-spindle lathe with live tooling)", "CNC machining", "Stamping (production stampings, stamping dies, fixtures)", "Welding (MIG, TIG, robotic)", "Robotic welding (4 cells)", "Finishing", "Assembly (mechanical assembly, hardware kitting)", "Custom packaging", "Warehousing", "Distribution", "Inventory management", "Weld engineering", "Project management", "Custom tooling", "Shipping solutions", "Nesting software for sheet yield optimization", "Sheet processing up to 60\u2033 x 120\u2033", "Value-added services"], "industries": ["Defense & Military", "Aerospace", "Medical Device", "Fitness Equipment", "Oil & Gas", "Biogas Reclaiming", "Border Security", "Autonomous Vehicle", "Industrial Equipment", "Chemical Dispensing", "Clean Energy", "Material Handling", "Data Centers"], "materials": ["Sheet metal", "Heavy plate"], "equipment": ["4-axis vertical CNC machining centers", "Multi-spindle lathe turning centers with live tooling", "Four robotic welding cells", "State-of-the-art nesting software", "Sheet processing capacity 60\u2033 x 120\u2033"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Continuous investment in cutting\u2011edge technology and equipment", "In\u2011house domestic manufacturing, finishing, and assembly", "Four robotic welding cells for high\u2011volume production", "Sheet processing capacity up to 60\u2033 \u00d7 120\u2033", "ITAR registered and CMMC compliant for defense work"], "facts_used": ["Location: Cincinnati, O