UPDATE companies SET description='Microchip Auto Glass has operated from Tacoma, Washington since 2010. The company provides mobile auto glass repair and replacement services across the greater Puget Sound region, traveling to customers in cities including Seattle, Bellevue, Olympia, and surrounding communities.

The shop performs windshield replacement for passenger vehicles and semi-trucks, door glass replacement, sunroof replacement, window regulator repair and replacement, and ADAS calibration following glass replacement or collision work. Technicians use what the company describes as state-of-the-art equipment for recalibrating advanced driver assistance systems.

Customers range from individual vehicle owners to commercial fleets operating Peterbilt, Freightliner, Kenworth, Volvo, International, and Mack trucks. The fleet program emphasizes minimal downtime for businesses with multiple vehicles. The company also serves heavy-duty truck operators requiring windshield replacement that meets sealing and structural standards for long-haul operation.

Microchip Auto Glass distinguishes itself through mobile service delivery, a relatively uncommon focus on regulator and sunroof repairs, and ADAS calibration capability that many general glass shops do not offer. A warranty backs all windshield replacements, and the company highlights its ability to handle both passenger car and Class 8 truck glass work from the same mobile platform.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Windshield replacement (front/rear)", "Door glass replacement", "Semi-truck windshield replacement", "Sunroof replacement", "Window regulator repair and replacement", "Fleet auto glass service", "ADAS calibration", "Mobile/on-site installation"], "industries": ["Automotive repair", "Commercial fleet services", "Heavy-duty trucking", "Passenger vehicle service"], "materials": ["Automotive glass"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Mobile service \u2014 technicians travel to the customer location", "ADAS calibration with state-of-the-art equipment", "Window regulator repair and replacement (service not widely offered)", "Sunroof replacement specialization", "Fleet program structured for minimal vehicle downtime", "Warranty on all windshield replacements", "Courtesy vacuum cleaning during door glass replacement"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2010 -> db (hq_city/hq_state_label) and page ''/'' text ''Serving you since 2010''", "Headquarters Tacoma, Washington -> db", "Services: windshield, door glass, semi-truck, sunroof, regulator, fleet, ADAS calibration -> page ''/''", "Mobile service ''WE COME TO YOU'' -> page ''/''", "Service area list (Tacoma, Seattle, Bellevue, Olympia, etc.) -> page ''/''", "Semi-truck brands: Peterbilt, Freightliner, Kenworth, Volvo, International, Mack -> page ''/''", "Warranty on windshield replacements -> page ''/''", "Courtesy vacuum cleaning for door glass -> page ''/''", "State-of-the-art equipment for ADAS calibration -> page ''/''", "Fleet program for mini