s", "Racing Products and Custom Semi-Truck Sunvisors -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "specializing in the design and custom fabrication of carbon steel, stainless and aluminum products", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='midwest-sheet-metal-co' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 2009 in Madison, Wisconsin, Midwest Solar Power LLC was started by professionals with backgrounds in construction, project management, and customer service who aimed to modernize the solar installation business.

The company provides turnkey solar installation services for residential and small commercial customers throughout Dane County and southern Wisconsin. Its offerings include roof-mounted residential systems, ground-mount arrays for sites where roof installation is not feasible, and custom commercial installations for local businesses.

Midwest Solar Power serves homeowners seeking to reduce energy bills and businesses looking to lower operating costs through renewable energy. Commercial clients include small businesses in the Madison area that want tailored solar solutions designed to maximize investment and environmental impact. The company also assists customers with navigating incentives such as the federal 30% investment tax credit and emerging programs like the Home Energy Assistance Rebate (HEAR) program.

