LL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Mill Haven Foods, LLC operates from New Lisbon, Wisconsin, in the heart of the state''s dairy farmland, with additional facilities in Tomah, Wisconsin. The company is a subsidiary of Select Milk and has a sister company, Select Custom Solutions, based in La Crosse, Wisconsin. While the founding year is not publicly disclosed, the business was established to serve the dairy ingredient market with custom blending and packaging solutions.

The company specializes in the research, manufacture, blending, and packaging of dry dairy food ingredients for the food and beverage industry worldwide. Its newly designed facility houses state-of-the-art blending and packaging equipment, supported by a 77,000-square-foot warehouse with allergen-control segregation and an in-house lab capable of testing fat, protein, moisture, aerobic plate count, yeast, and mold. Annual production reaches 40 million pounds, and every ingredient lot undergoes third-party purity and identity testing before use.

Mill Haven Foods serves the food and beverage, dairy, and supplement industries, providing custom blending, ingredient sourcing, private labeling, and contract manufacturing to customers worldwide. Its client base includes businesses further servicing the dairy industry, leveraging long-standing relationships with major ingredient manufacturers and distributors to secure competitive pricing and consistent protein supply.

The company emphasizes quality as its primary differentiator, maintaining NSF certification, Orthodox Union kosher certification, GMP compliance, Informed Choice program participation, and gluten-free certification through GFCO. A rigorous vendor approval program requires third-party audits and annual re-qualification, while internal QA teams conduct facility visits. Competitive pricing, stable sourcing, and a comprehensive testing regimen — both in-house and via third-party labs — underpin its value proposition.', certifications=ARRAY['NSF Certified','Kosher Certified (Orthodox Union)','GMP Compliant','Informed Choice','Gluten Free Certification Organization (GFCO)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom blending", "Packaging", "Ingredient sourcing", "Private labeling", "Contract manufacturing", "Quality testing (fat, protein, moisture, APC, yeast, mold)", "Allergen-control storage", "Vendor qualification and audit program"], "industries": ["Food and beverage", "Dairy", "Supplement"], "materials": ["Dry dairy food ingredients", "Proteins"], "equipment": ["State-of-the-art blending equipment", "State-of-the-art packaging equipment", "State-of-the-art lab equipment (fat, protein, moisture, APC, yeast, mold)"], "volume": "40 million pounds annually", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["40 million pounds annual production capacity", "77,000 sq ft warehouse with allergen-control segregation", "NSF, Kosher (OU), GMP, Informed Choice, and GFCO gluten-free certifications", "Third-party purity and identity testing on every ingredient lot", "In-house lab for fat, protein, moisture, APC, yeast, and mold analysis"], "facts_used": ["Location: New Lisbon, WI -> /services", "Additional facilities: Tomah, WI -> /", "Parent company: Select Milk -> /", "Sister company: Select Custom Solutions -> /", "Specialization: dry dairy food ingredients, custom blending/packaging -> /services", "Annual production: 40 million pounds -> /services", "Warehouse: 77,000 sq ft with allergen control -> /services", "In-house lab capabilities -> /services", "Third-party lot testing -> /services", "Certifications: NSF, OU Kosher, GMP, Informed Choice, GFCO -> /services", "Industries served: food/beverage, dairy, supplement -> /services", "Services: custom blending, packaging, ingredient sourcing, private labeling, contract manufacturing -> /services", "Vendor qualification program -> /services", "Competitive pricing via major ingredient relationships -> /services", "GMP certification listed in database -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We specialize in the basic research and manufacture of dry dairy food ingredients by offering custom blending and packaging solutions to the food and beverage industry worldwide.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='mill-haven-foods' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Millard Manufacturing Corporation is based in La Vista, Nebraska, just outside Omaha. The privately held company was founded in 1986 and has grown into a stainless steel fabricator that designs, builds, and installs custom machinery for industrial food processing plants.

The company operates a facility of over 100,000 square feet with ten assembly bays, ten loading docks, high-bay ceilings, overhead cranes, and an automated material handling system. Its shop is equipped for laser cutting, water jet cutting, TIG/MIG welding, and an in-house passivation operation (Millard PassPro™). Engineering services include 2D/3D CAD design, cooperative design, and preliminary layout development. The company also provides factory acceptance testing, installation, and spare-parts support, and it can source raw materials such as aluminum, carbon steel, galvanized steel, and stainless steel through its affiliated Millard Metal Services.

Millard serves core food-processing sectors including beef, pork, and poultry processors, canning operations, and fresh and frozen food plants. Additional markets span animal health, bakery, dairy, pet food, pharmaceutical, prepared foods, seafood, vegetable processing, ethanol, grain milling, chemical plants, and wastewater facilities. Customers range from small operations to large corporations nationwide.

