UPDATE companies SET description='Min Plastics & Supply, Inc. was founded in 1950 by K.Y. Min in Honolulu, Hawaii. The company began as an entrepreneurial venture supplying quality acrylic products to local businesses and individuals in post-war Hawaii. Today it remains a family-owned business, operated by the second and third generations of the Min family from its facility in the Iwilei district.

The company functions as both a distributor and a fabricator. It stocks one of the largest inventories of engineered plastic sheets in the Pacific — including acrylic, polycarbonate, expanded PVC, HDPE, ABS, polypropylene, UHMW, nylon, acetal, and PETG — and runs a full-service fabrication shop equipped with CNC panel saws, CNC routers, and laser cutting and engraving systems. Services span material sourcing, cut-to-size parts, precision CNC routing, laser cutting and engraving, and custom fabrication and assembly for projects ranging from single pieces to large-scale installations.

Min Plastics serves construction, signage, marine, environmental, manufacturing, industrial, and government agencies across Hawaii, as well as specialized sectors such as maritime research, retail, and museum and art display cases. Its customer base includes commercial contractors, institutional clients, public-sector entities, designers, and builders who rely on the company for material guidance and finished components.

The firm emphasizes removing guesswork from plastics selection and fabrication. It promises quote responses within one business day, a remake-at-no-charge guarantee if cut parts deviate from quoted dimensions, and end-to-end support from material selection through installation. This approach, built over 75 years, positions the company as a local partner that combines commercial-grade inventory with Hawaii-specific logistics knowledge.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Material sourcing and procurement", "Cut-to-size services", "CNC routing", "Laser cutting and engraving", "Custom fabrication and assembly", "Plastic bending and welding", "Machining", "CNC panel saw cutting"], "industries": ["Construction", "Signage", "Marine", "Environmental", "Manufacturing", "Industrial", "Government agencies", "Maritime research", "Retail", "Museum and art display cases"], "materials": ["Acrylic", "Polycarbonate", "Expanded PVC", "HDPE", "ABS", "Polypropylene", "UHMW", "Nylon", "Acetal", "PETG", "Mirror", "Starboard", "Delrin"], "equipment": ["CNC panel saws", "CNC routing equipment", "Laser cutting and engraving equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded 1950 by K.Y. Min in Honolulu -> /about-us", "Family-owned, second and third generations -> /about-us", "Premier distributor and full-service fabrication facility -> /about-us", "Largest inventory of plastic sheets in the Pacific -> /about-us", "Authorized distributor for PLEXIGLAS\u00ae, Tuffak\u00ae, Makrolon\u00ae, Celtec\u00ae, etc. -> /about-us", "Services: material sourcing, cut-to-size, CNC routing, laser cutting/engraving, fabrication & assembly -> /services", "Equipment: CNC panel saws, CNC routers, laser equipment -> /services", "Industries served: construction, signage, marine, environmental, manufacturing, industrial, government, maritime research, retail, museum cases -> /about-us", "Quote response within one business day -> /", "Re