UPDATE companies SET description='Miscellaneous Stainless & Steel Works LLC (MSSW) was founded in 2004 in Durham, North Carolina. The company is owner‑operated and specializes in custom metal fabrication and installation for commercial, industrial, and retail projects across the state.

