UPDATE companies SET description='Mitokine Bio Science was founded in 2006 in Hancock, Maine, by Dr. Brooke Ligon, a board-certified neurologist with a doctorate in neuroscience from Tufts Graduate School of Biomedical Sciences. The company began with a mission to develop a novel treatment for diabetes, a research program that has since been taken forward by Diamyd Medical in Sweden.

Today the firm operates as a scientific information resource, concentrating on the biology of GABA and its relevance to Alzheimer’s disease. Dr. Ligon authors and curates the content, drawing on her clinical and research background. No manufacturing facility, production volumes, or part numbers are disclosed; the output is published research summaries and educational material rather than physical goods.

The organization’s work is linked to several academic and philanthropic institutions, including Tufts Medical Center’s Department of Surgery, Molecular Cardiology Research Institute, and GRASP Center, as well as Tufts University’s Neuroscience Department and Vice Provost Office for Industry Collaboration. The Kyle Family Foundation, a charitable entity that supports medical research, is also noted as a connected party.

Mitokine states that its distinguishing feature is a sustained commitment to innovative research that addresses medical problems and improves patients’ daily lives. The transition from an internal diabetes drug program to an open information platform on GABA and neurodegeneration reflects that stated purpose.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Scientific research on GABA and Alzheimer''s disease", "Medical information dissemination"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Diabetes research program adopted and extended by Diamyd Medical in Sweden", "Content authored by a board-certified neurologist with a Tufts neuroscience doctorate", "Exclusive focus on GABA science and Alzheimer\u2019s disease information", "Stated commitment to research that impacts medical problems and patient daily life"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2006 -> page:/", "Headquarters in Hancock, Maine -> db", "Founder Dr. Brooke Ligon M.D. Ph.D., board-certified neurologist, Tufts neuroscience graduate -> page:/", "Original mission: develop diabetes treatment -> page:/", "Diabetes research extended by Diamyd Medical in Sweden -> page:/", "Current focus: information on GABA and Alzheimer''s disease -> page:/", "Affiliations with Tufts Medical Center departments and institutes -> db", "Affiliation with Tufts University Neuroscience Department and Vice Provost Office -> db", "Connection to Kyle Family Foundation -> db", "Stated commitment to innovative research impacting medical problems and patient lives -> page:/"], "company_type": "Other", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Our current focus is providing information on the science of GABA and Alzheimer''s disease.", "founded_year": "2006", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='mitokine-bio-science' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Mitsubishi International Food Ingredients, Inc. (MIFI) operates its Dublin, Ohio office as part of a wholly-owned subsidiary of Mitsubishi Corporation. The company has refined its network of food-grade warehouses and carrier partnerships since 2004, building a distribution infrastructure that spans the United States.

MIFI sources and distributes more than 1,000 food, nutritional, and pharmaceutical ingredients, including custom seasoning blends developed through its formulation and applications expertise. All warehouses are GMP-compliant and FDA-registered, and the company manages a fleet of LTL and TL carriers that adhere to federal and state requirements. Over 90 percent of customers receive next-day service from its prepared and well-stocked facilities.

The company serves consumer packaged goods (CPG) companies ranging from large corporations to small independent shops across industries such as food, nutrition and supplements, pharmaceuticals, biotech, cosmetics, and pet products. Its quality assurance team, staffed by professionals certified in PCQI, FSVP, HACCP, and cGMP, engages directly with global supply chain partners to verify supplier qualifications.

MIFI differentiates itself through a dedicated customer service model that avoids third-party call centers, guaranteeing direct access to empowered representatives. The team proactively monitors order fulfillment, confirms forecasts, and explores flexible shipping options to meet go-to-market deadlines, reflecting a mission to deliver beyond expectations while operating to the highest ethical and safety standards.', certifications=ARRAY['GMP','FDA-registered','PCQI','FSVP','HACCP','cGMP']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Dedicated customer service (direct access, no call center)", "Quality assurance (PCQI, FSVP, HACCP, cGMP)", "Custom seasoning blend formulation", "Food-grade warehousing and distribution", "Supplier qualification and verification program", "LTL/TL carrier management", "Proactive order tracking and forecast confirmation", "Flexible shipping to meet go-to-market timelines"], "industries": ["Food", "Nutrition & Supplements", "Pharmaceuticals", "Biotech", "Cosmetics", "Pet"], "materials": ["Food ingredients", "Nutritional ingredients", "Pharmaceutical ingredients", "Custom seasoning blends"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Next-day service for over 90% of customers", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No third-party call center; customers speak directly with empowered representatives", "Proactive connectivity throughout order fulfillment and forecast confirmation", "Flexible shipping options to meet go-to-market timeframes", "Quality assurance team with PCQI, FSVP, HACCP, and cGMP certifications", "Next-day delivery to over 90% of customers nationwide"], "facts_used": ["Wholly-owned subsidiary of Mitsubishi Corporation -> /", "Since 2004, refined network of food-grade warehouses and LTL/TL carriers -> /", "1,000+ food, nutritional, and pharmaceutical products distributed -> /", "GMP warehouses are food-grade and FDA-registered -> /", "Over 90% of customers receive next-day service -> /", "Serves CPG companies from corporations to small shops -> /", "Industries: Food, Nutrition & Supplements, Pharmaceuticals, Biotech, Cosmetics, Pet -> /", "Quality assurance team with PCQI, FSVP, HACCP, cGMP certifications -> /", "Dedicated customer service: no third-party call center, direct human access -> /", "Proactive connectivity throughout order fulfillment -> /", "Flexible shipping options to meet go-to-market timeframe -> /", "Headquarters: Dublin, Ohio -> db", "Company type: Distributor -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Mitsubishi International Food Ingredients, Inc. (\"MIFI\") sources and distributes domestic and international food, custom seasoning blends, nutritional, and pharmaceutical ingredients for the CPG companies", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='mitsubishi-international-food-ingredients-inc-dublin-office' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
