UPDATE companies SET description='Mocorp Custom Metal Fabrication operates from Ramsey, Minnesota, delivering custom commercial metal fabrication and welding services. The company serves original equipment manufacturers across automation industries as well as clients in retail, hospitality, and restaurant sectors.

Its shop provides bending capacity up to 168 inches in length with 350-ton presses, rolling up to 96 inches with a maximum sheet thickness of 1/2-inch plate, and recently added CNC machining to complement its fabrication and welding offerings.

The company emphasizes long-term relationships, with many clients returning for multiple projects over years.

